# Logs
# NOTE: anchored to the project root ("/logs") so it only ignores a
# top-level build/debug-log output folder — NOT any directory named "logs"
# anywhere in the source tree (this used to silently swallow
# src/components/pages/logs/ and everything inside it).
/logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
